Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们生来非凡 我的孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are extraordinary, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,超脱世人的认知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike anything the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,注定成就伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bound for greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,注定要保护纽约的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destined to protect the people of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一股黑暗势力正在发展壮大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dark force is growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就是一个名为"大脚帮"的犯罪组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A criminal organization known as the Foot Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们因肆意践踏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So named because they step over
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约人民而得名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the good people of this city with no regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的头目 施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their leader, The Shredder,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,将会残忍袭击你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will come at you with ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他的爪牙人多势众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His Foot Clan will outnumber you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约人民将把你们视作唯一的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of New York will look upon you as their only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,集中精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,收紧双肘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elbows locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,准备战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stance low.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,即刻行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,与剑合二为一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be one with the blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,扫清前路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead their path.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们已经迫不及待想倾听他们的诉求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you are eager to answer their calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们的训练仍未结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but your training is not yet complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,地下世界仍为你们的居所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world below must remain your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须信任我 你们的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As your father, you must trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,耐心等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.35,0:02:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,潜心修炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们仍未准备好进入城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not yet ready to go above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信当那天来临时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe when that day comes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当你们走上地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you rise to the streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们将会做出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are going to be responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一番伟大的事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for amazing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.38,0:02:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,利维迪先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Rivetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,利维迪先生 利维迪先生 求您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Rivetti. Mr. Rivetti, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对是我这辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the most persistent human
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,见到过的最难缠的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've ever met in my life, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经把知道的都告诉警察了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I already told the cops everything, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但也有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe there's a detail
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你漏了一点细节忘记说了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could've forgotten to share with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美女 这种事我不可能会忘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, you don't forget something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,光天化日的 十个人强闯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten guys storm in here, broad daylight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用枪指着我们让我们趴地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}force us to the ground at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是机密化学品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these are restricted chemicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,苄基氰还有脱氨基剂什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benzyl cyanide and some deaminating agents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,市面上根本买不到 黑市都买不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't just buy this stuff, even on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你刚刚说到脱氨基剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, you said deaminating agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是用于基因研究的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those are used in genetic research.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,除了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anybody else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别人运输这种化学品吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's trafficking these sort of chemicals besides you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.19,0:03:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这码头上还有另一家 戒备很森严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one other high-security facility along this waterfront.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.61,0:03:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们的运输量没我们的大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they don't move nearly as much cargo as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 半小时后就要直播了 快点成吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil! We're live in 30 minutes! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... No, no, no, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,请等我一会儿 我很快就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't go anywhere. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你想害死我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我在做事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有钱拿吗 - 没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a paying job? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.39,0:03:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有钱拿的事都还没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we have an actual paying job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.90,0:03:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得市里每一个报道犯罪的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you don't think that every crime reporter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,都在拼命挖大脚帮的故事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the city has been trying to work this Foot Clan story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但有一个新的角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that, but there is a new angle on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很快就要挖到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am this close to getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要一点…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need a couple of more...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是专注做好我们擅长的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just stick to what we're good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,专注做好我们擅长的事就好了 我们可厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's stick to what we're good at. We're good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,五 四…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In five, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好 我是第六新闻频道的爱普莉尔·奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, guys, this is April O'Neil from Channel 6 News
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,此刻我在美丽的纽约市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I am here in beautiful New York City
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就在初春第一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the first day of spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道我想说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,又到了甩掉烦人冬膘的时候啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time to shed that pesky winter weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们的嘉宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here with me today
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是著名的健身教练哈里·帕斯特纳克 你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is celebrity fitness trainer Harley Pasternak. Hi, Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,二十年前我研究过动物王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty years I've studied the animal kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,里边有肥猪和胖牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are fat pigs, there are fat cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有胖鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no fat birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 你现在设想自己是一只性感的海鸥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I want you to visualize a sexy seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要蹲下挥动你的翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're going to squat down and flap your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样 最大限度去摆动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right over there. Full extension.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,想象你正在飞离寒冷的北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Picture you're leaving the cold north
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,挥动翅膀 你正在迁移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're flying. You're migrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,念了四年新闻专业就为了做这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four years of journalism school so that I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,整整四年啊 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four years of my life, Vern.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太丢人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 奥尼尔 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, O'Neil, I get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你想当一名正经的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you want to be a serious journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你在新闻编辑室附近转悠找大新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you sniffing around the newsroom for the big stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但给人们带来一些轻松的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's also okay to just give people something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,一点…新闻白沫也不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little lighter. A little... little froth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.65,0:04:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,新闻白沫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Froth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,新闻白沫就是 比如你拿一杯普普通通的咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, how, when you get a coffee, it's just, like, coffee,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,加点白沫在面上的话 就显得更好看更好喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then they put a little froth on it. It's kind of nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 那叫泡沫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, that's foam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 管它泡沫还是白沫 反正你懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, foam, froth, you get the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,反正很好看很美味像糖一样甜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just... It's nice, it tastes good, it's candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:04:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听别人说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard the expression,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"永远不要抢走孩子的糖"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Never take candy from a baby"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为就连孩子都喜欢吃糖啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's because even babies love candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,美味就行 你就是在给予人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice. And you're giving people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们所喜欢的又好又美味的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something they like that's good and nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看着你就在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look at you and they see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"哇 这真是一个美丽的 的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Wow, there's a nice... There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,甜妞" 总之重点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"...candy". The point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该得到嘉奖啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that you should be rewarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,别老虐自己 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not punishing yourself. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我准备奖励你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm... I'm prepared to reward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.55,0:05:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去市中心吧 去我兄弟的老餐馆搓一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say that we go to my buddy's old restaurant downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那里气氛挺好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very vibey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来这儿的路上刚吃过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just ate on the way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这我知道… 我是说 不吃正餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I know we just... I'm not saying for a full meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去吃点儿开胃菜什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're just gonna eat appetizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去把采访做完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to go finish that interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,办公室见 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you at the office, Vern!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,回见吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will see you at the office!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想继续采访你 利维迪先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to follow up, Mr. Rivetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么 你怎么弄到我号码的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? How did you get my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想再问一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could just ask one more question...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个案子我已经把知道的全告诉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I already told you everything I know about this crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有的 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- everything. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你想知道别的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you wanna know anything else,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就回码头去找一个叫斯坦的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go back down to the docks and you see my guy Stan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道的他都会告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll tell you anything else you need to know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 行行好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And hey, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:05:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的号码删掉好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose my number, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,安全 都打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clear. Let's open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,罐子没问题 继续搬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Container's good. Move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,全装上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get those to the trucks now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,走 去下一个地方 快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move out, next point! Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第六频道 - 克里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Channel 6. - Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克里斯 我是爱普莉尔 我在码头这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chris, it's April. I'm at the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这大半夜的 奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're at the middle of the evening break O'Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,无论什么新闻都等明天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you got can wait for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 我看到化学品…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, I see chemical...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.07,0:06:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,2-3-2 安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2-3-2, clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都弄走 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get it out of my way. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,第二小队 第三区 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unit two, area three, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这边有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got movement!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,注意这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,允许开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons free!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,都别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold position!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,泰勒 泰勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taylor. Taylor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我在和我妈聊天呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. I'm Skyping with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会相信我刚刚看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what I just went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,吓死我了 我看到有人袭击大脚帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am freaking out. I saw a Foot Clan attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我在码头边上骑自行车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was riding my bike by the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.65,0:08:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上天都黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was night, it's dark already
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那里到处都是大脚帮的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there are Foot Clan soldiers everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,接着不知道从哪儿出来一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then out of nowhere, there was this guy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,开始对抗他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fighting back against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还留下了一个标志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he... he left behind this symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前肯定见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但的的确确有人在对抗大脚帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is someone fighting back against the Foot Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,城里出现了正义卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a vigilante in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道 除了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one knows, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 现在我找到大新闻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. And now I have my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和白沫和泡沫说拜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no more froth and foam for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚的新闻头条 有谁有想法吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we need a lead for tonight. Who's got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,曼哈顿下城区重建提案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Major redevelopments proposed for Lower Manhattan."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我这儿有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约警署特遣队降低了大脚帮犯罪率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"NYPD task force taking credit for small decline in Foot-related crime."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错 就用这个 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like that. Let's run with that. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,早七点新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7:00 am broadcast,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有三分钟开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have three minutes to air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 我一会儿再和你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, O'Neil. I'll talk to you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我跑这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that I'm actually overstepping
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是越线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my boundaries by being here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得你会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think that you're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually think that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,都会想听我接下来要说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all gonna want to hear what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚在布鲁克林我亲眼目睹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I witnessed an attempted Foot Clan robbery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮在码头想偷窃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the docks in Brooklyn last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 是有人听到枪声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, the scanner said that gunshots were heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有任何大脚帮活动的相关报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there were no reports of any Foot Clan activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为他们被人制止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because whatever they were attempting to do was stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,话说你去布鲁克林做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing in Brooklyn anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有蹦床大会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there a trampoline convention?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去布鲁克林是因为我在追踪报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in Brooklyn because I was reporting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是干坐在办公桌后面 麦克诺顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not sitting behind my desk, McNaughton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谁阻止了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who stopped it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有这么个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there was this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看清 但他抡起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see him clearly, but he was swinging
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的运输集装箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these giant shipping containers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把那些家伙撞进了…河里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and knocking these guys into the... into the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有一名正义卫士在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a vigilante that is fighting back
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,抗击大脚帮 这可是个大新闻啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against the Foot Clan. There's a huge story here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 你可能看到了超人啊 太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil, I think you found Superman. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有正义卫士 我看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vigilante is real. I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 我得说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil, I'm gonna assume
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有确切的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you would not come up here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就这么跑到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell us this fantastic story
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们这个奇幻故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without some tangible proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我拍下了其中一个集装箱的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took this photo of one of the shipping containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这就是他在场的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I actually think that it may be his calling card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么都不是 奥尼尔 什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nothing, O'Neil. This is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有人阻止了大脚帮却没留下证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody stopped a Foot robbery and left no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我把"什么都没有"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted me to put "Nothing"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放到晚间新闻上是吧 - 当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- on the nightly news. - Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.26,0:11:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我就当你什么都没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm gonna pretend we never had this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm erasing it from my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人动起来 开工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rest of us, we're gonna go back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好 头条新闻准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, we're ready for the topic story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好 欢迎收看第六频道早间新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, everybody. Welcome to the Channel 6 Morning News.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大家将看到有关卫生罢工的最新进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New developments in that ongoing sanitation strike to tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先 在与警察局长共同反思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first, after reviewing the city's soaring crime rates
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,城内上升的犯罪率之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the police commissioner,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,丹·格雷戈尔议员在市政厅采取举措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Councilman Dan Gregor took to the steps of City Hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,重申了纽约城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reaffirming the city's commitment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.37,0:11:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,打击犯罪组织的决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to fight against the rising crime organization
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,该犯罪组织名为大脚帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calling themselves the Foot Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在他与埃里克·赛克斯以及赛克斯企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did so on the heels of a renewed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,重新签订相关合同之后采取的举措\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}contract with Eric Sacks and Sacks Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,利用赛克斯的研究以及安全技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using the Sacks research and securities technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约城抗击大脚帮的成功率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this city greatly improves its chances
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,将会大大增加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of bringing the Foot Clan to justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.89,0:12:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 你的人太弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 难怪你会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道那个所谓的正义卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We couldn't have anticipated the vigilante
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,会在码头出现 施莱德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}showing up at the docks, Master Shredder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 你们不是训练过怎样应对这种突发情况吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们从未见过那样的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we've never seen an enemy like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的身形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their size.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还有力量都前所未见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信神话故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,社会倒是想把大脚帮也变成那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what society wants to reduce the Foot Clan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,变成传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但大脚帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Foot Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,会东山再起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何都要把正义卫士抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capture the vigilantes however you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,用无辜的人当诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use innocent people as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.33,0:13:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能阻止我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will stop us in our quest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,重获胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reclaim victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会拿下这座城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will own this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请允许我为您介绍纽约警局的最大资助人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please join me in welcoming the NYPD's top benefactor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,埃里克·赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric Sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.96,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚能够见到诸位 我感到不胜荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's wonderful to see so many people out here tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是我们这里一直苦于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially in a neighborhood so hard hit
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮的残虐暴行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the Foot's crime wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,几年前 我的人生遭遇了悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years ago, my life was touched by tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是一名年轻的科学家 与顶级团队合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a young scientist working with a world-class team
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,做最前沿的研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on cutting-edge research.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们的实验室被人袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our laboratory was attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,被人放火 抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}set fire to, robbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手就是那些自称为大脚帮的懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the cowards that call themselves the Foot Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的几位员工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Several of my employees
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在那天失去了生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lost their lives that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,以铭记他们 向他们致敬的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is in their honor, in their memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯企业 不论是赛克斯生物医学公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Sacks Industries, whether through Sacks Biomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯机器人科学公司 或是赛克斯建筑公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks Robotics or Sacks Construction,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会保证我们这座城市 纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keeping the city of New York, our city,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不论谁将这座城市置于险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whenever someone takes flame to this city,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我都会救其于危难之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be there to put the fire out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:14:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我向各位保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,先生您讲得真好 非常鼓舞人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great work, sir. Very inspirational.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,塞克斯先生 我是爱普莉尔·奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sacks. April O'Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,您以前跟我父亲是同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You worked with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信 我上次见你是在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. I haven't seen you since...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是在父亲的葬礼上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since his funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很久之前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想跟您说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,您的话让我产生了很大的共鸣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your words really resonated with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I hope to one day
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,也能像您一样为这个城市做贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}contribute to the city in the way that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在已经做得很不错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it looks like you're doing a pretty good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,第六频道 厉害啊 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Channel 6, very impressive, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 其实…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那并不完全是我期待的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it isn't exactly everything I anticipated it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你坦诚正直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you are true to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲就会为你自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your father will always be proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯先生 您7点要去上城区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sacks, we have to be uptown at 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,期待在电视上看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you on TV.
