Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大家这是要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's everybody going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爱普莉尔 - 请问出了什么事 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- April! - Hey! What are you running from? Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有人开枪 百老汇和中心街交界处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shots fired, Broadway and Centre Street.
