Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在百老汇舞台附近有大批大脚帮在活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heavy Foot Clan activity at the Broad Street platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,还到处抓人质…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And taking hostages with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们不能随便上去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know we're not supposed to go above ground.
