Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,做事情要有始有终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We started something, we gotta finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这猫在用筷子弹《筷子曲》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That cat is playing Chopsticks with chopsticks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别犯蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be an idiot.
