Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,开始行动吧 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's rock 'n' roll, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.03,0:17:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不想死 就快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to live, do it! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.13,0:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.19,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,把手举到我能看见的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your hands where I can see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,退到边上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move to the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是炸弹 - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're bombs. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know you're out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不出来投降 我们就开始处决人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't surrender, we start executing hostages!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,低下头 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your head down! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别让我再说一次 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me tell you again! Not a word!
