Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 行动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,来无影去无踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a shadow, bra.
