Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们往那边去了 - 你看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They went that way! - Did you see what happened here?
