Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这里 - 什么怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right here. - Some kind of freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有好几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were a couple of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬间经过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo! Right past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们救了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,行动起来 两边包抄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, guys! Both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was amazing. You were incredible!
