Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,直接秒杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo, Tang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,爽 看到那货下巴直接磕地上了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, yeah! Did you see that guy's jaw connect with the concrete?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,估计几个月喝水都得用吸的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be drinking out of a sippy cup for months!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的就是这感觉 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, that's what I'm talking about, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来无影去无踪 没人看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like shadows in the night. Completely unseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚好像是闪光灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a camera flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,废话 问题是闪光灯后面是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know it's a camera flash. Who's behind the camera flash?
