Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去处理掉她 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna kill her. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,用善意处理啦 送点花 博得好感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With kindness, give her some flowers, earn her trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来吧 - 拉斐 不要 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got this. - Raph, no, no, no! Come on!
