Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 他学蝙蝠侠说话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, look, he's doing his Batman voice.
