Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,退下 拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off, Raph.
