Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟 青少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turtle, teenagers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么一说 感觉好荒谬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when you put it like that, it sounds ridiculous!
