Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在找这个吗 - 别弄坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looking for this? - Don't break it.
