Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凭什么你说了算 - 你知道凭什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And who put you in charge? - You know who did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,又剑拔弩张了 半小时前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, tension! It's been like 30 whole minutes
