Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.73,0:24:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥纳多 我见过这些名字 我见过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonardo. I know those names. I know those names.
