Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.11,0:25:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.22,0:25:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,请问你在做什么样的实验呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what sort of experiments are you doing here?
