Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.20,0:26:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,正义卫士 我看到了 我看到他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vigilante, I saw him. I saw them! I saw them.
