Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.41,0:26:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的热扫描器显示有74%的变量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My thermal scans indicate there's a 74% variable
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.04,0:26:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是有61%的可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there's a 61% chance he's not...
