Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.09,0:26:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,前进 保持安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall in, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.00,0:27:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.56,0:27:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,以防我之前表现得不够明显 那妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, guys, if it wasn't already obvious with that girl,
