Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.03,0:27:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们创作到一半的嘻哈圣诞节专辑怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna finish our hip-hop Christmas album, bro?
