Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.32,0:28:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看呐 麦奇边睡觉边走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mikey's sleeping and walking.
