Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.44,0:28:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们一定要这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's how it's going to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.46,0:28:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去边端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the Ha'shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.79,0:28:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.03,0:28:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 有什么事非得我亲自过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, what was so important I had to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 你准备好了吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Are you ready? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.21,0:28:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道我看到了正义卫士吧 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. You know how I saw the vigilante? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.88,0:28:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我没有照片或者其他的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I had no photos or evidence to show you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以你觉得我疯了 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- so I just sounded crazy. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.49,0:28:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 但是我又见到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. But I saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.61,0:28:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,其实并不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I didn't see him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了他们 因为总共有四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw them, because there's four.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不止一个 是四个 并且我就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's not just one, there's four. And I was standing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.49,0:28:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他们面对面对视过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as close to them as you are to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.04,0:28:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们长什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.72,0:28:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.59,0:28:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.93,0:28:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.23,0:29:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,像乌龟一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like turtles?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.50,0:29:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们并不是看起来像乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they don't look like turtles
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.27,0:29:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们就是乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because they are turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们身高超过1米83 并且会说英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're over six feet tall and they speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.09,0:29:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.96,0:29:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我整夜都没睡 请你看一下 我整夜都没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was awake all night, please look, I was awake all night
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.71,0:29:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在查过去三个月内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}googling all of the thwarted crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们阻止的犯罪 还有这个符号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the past three months, and this symbol
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.85,0:29:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在每个犯罪现场都出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appeared at every single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.39,0:29:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看 真的是每一个都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.06,0:29:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 看 这里 这里 这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one, look. Here, here, here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.27,0:29:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是古老的日语词汇 代表家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's an ancient Japanese symbol that means "Family."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.25,0:29:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我电脑上有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, it's on my laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然叫我来看这些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you brought me in to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这 就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我父亲的实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my father's lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.05,0:29:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这个实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the same lab
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他们的出生地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where these things were born
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.43,0:29:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或是创造地 变异地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or created or mutated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么用术语说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or, I don't know the terminology,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.46,0:29:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你看看这个视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but will you please just look at what
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 这些都是有联系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm showing you and listen to me. It's all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.47,0:29:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这些乌龟就是正义卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The turtles are the vigilantes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.29,0:29:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,正义卫士就是这些乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the vigilantes are these turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.29,0:29:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,披萨上面有奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pizza has cheese,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.94,0:29:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,番茄酱 都是你们喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tomato sauce, all your favorite stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.68,0:29:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了吧 你们需要营养 也许不需要吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat it. You guys need nutrition. Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.85,0:29:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想弄清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.10,0:29:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在跟我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now telling me that there are
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.59,0:30:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有四只1米83的会说话乌龟穿梭在纽约城内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}four six-foot talking turtles walking around New York city,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可除了你 没人看到过他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no one has seen them but you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我想说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.90,0:30:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是故意想笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean to laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.85,0:30:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有什么相关信息要告诉我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but is there anything else we should know about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.92,0:30:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是忍者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.27,0:30:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.13,0:30:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还会空手道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they do karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.53,0:30:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.54,0:30:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,其实也没有很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could have been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚被解雇 弗恩 怎么能不糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got fired, Vern. How could it be worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.72,0:30:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是好事呢 也许你可以放个假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's good. Maybe you should take a little time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.84,0:30:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好好照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.41,0:30:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我来捎你一段路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let me give you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你要去埃里克·赛克斯庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unless you're going to the Eric Sacks estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.59,0:30:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爱普莉尔 - 我是不会放弃这个报道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- April... Hey! - I'm not giving up on this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.18,0:30:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是放弃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta put that to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.10,0:30:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你合作过的其他优秀记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would all of those other great reporters
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.68,0:30:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也会放弃自己的报道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you worked with, would they have "Put it to bed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.79,0:30:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.97,0:30:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.13,0:30:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是从我这样开始的 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They all started exactly where I am, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.18,0:31:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能开着第六频道的车去埃里克·赛克斯庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not driving the Channel 6 news van onto the Sacks estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.93,0:31:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁让你去了 - 你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who asked you to do that? - Uh, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.05,0:31:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你只要说声谢谢就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a "Thanks" would have been nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.63,0:31:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有一天 你会感谢我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe one day you're gonna be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.87,0:31:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要找埃里克·赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you want with Eric Sacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.48,0:31:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸曾为他工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad used to work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他能够告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only person that's gonna be able
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.16,0:31:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是真的太疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell me whether or not I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.18,0:31:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,笑话我的人已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need you to laugh at me also.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.35,0:31:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, O'Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是芬威克专车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Fenwick Express,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.47,0:31:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里言论自由 是你绝对放心的小窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a judgment-free zone. A cocoon of safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.64,0:31:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,保证吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.13,0:31:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然会怀疑我 我受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm insulted that you would suggest otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.05,0:31:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在边端待了十一个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, 11 hours in the Ha'shi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.66,0:31:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的没有人愿意告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure none of you want to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.64,0:31:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们昨晚去了哪里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you were last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持得怎么样 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you holding up, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.78,0:31:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼能撑住 我就能撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't breaking if Donnie ain't breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想吐 不过我能撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Experiencing intense nausea but not breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.37,0:32:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙 我进状态了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys? I'm in the zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.09,0:32:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的我绝对是无懈可击 坚如磐石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is literally nothing that could break me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.94,0:32:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要坚持不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.61,0:32:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你们都尝过五层芝士披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, you've all tasted the five-cheese pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.51,0:32:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,乳酪商们花了几个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cheesemongers have speculated
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.35,0:32:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在探索它的奥妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of its existence for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,达芬奇的原创经典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da Vinci's original masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.02,0:32:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请欣赏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I submit to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.79,0:32:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,九九芝士披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the 99-cheese pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.84,0:32:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直不现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 这是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, it's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.22,0:32:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一张披萨上根本放不了那么多芝士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pizza with that variety of cheese is a culinary impossibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.45,0:32:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要我列一下具体的成分吗 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shall I list the ingredients? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.70,0:32:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,干酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheddar...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.46,0:32:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 波萝伏洛干酪 - 麦奇 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Provolone... - Mikey, don't you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.32,0:32:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,艾斯阿格芝士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asiago...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.50,0:32:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,软奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taleggio...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.99,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至都不知道那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.83,0:32:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,当然还有 马苏里拉奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mozzarella, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.96,0:33:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我招了 我们昨天出去是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right, all right! We left the lair
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.82,0:33:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大脚帮在绑架人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the Foot were taking hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收拾了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we kicked some serious butt,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.75,0:33:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,后来出现了一个叫爱普莉尔·奥尼尔的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there was this girl named April O'Neil
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她拍了我们的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who took our picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.96,0:33:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们都处理好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.41,0:33:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.59,0:33:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我最担心的事情终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, my worst fears have been realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.73,0:33:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 多尼删了那些照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. Donnie erased the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.60,0:33:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并没有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.28,0:33:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 爱普莉尔·奥尼尔会有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's April O'Neil who is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,找到那个女孩 把她带过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the girl. Bring her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.56,0:33:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 老师 你说过不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sensei, you said to not go...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.01,0:33:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,找到那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,找到那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我给汤普森说了这些 她就开除了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I told Thompson and she fired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.03,0:33:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是外星人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they're aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.40,0:33:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.46,0:33:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是爬行动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're reptiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.04,0:33:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们帮助人们 我猜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They help people, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.90,0:33:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,龟壳中的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heroes in the half-shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.66,0:33:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 也没那么疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Come on. It's not that crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.65,0:33:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我 动物王国充满了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... The animal kingdom is full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾养过一只会太空步的狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to have a dog that could moonwalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.87,0:34:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢你送我 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the ride, Vern.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.76,0:34:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.17,0:34:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最"棒"的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing better than
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就是把一位美女送到一个有钱男人家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dropping off a pretty girl at a rich guy's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.47,0:34:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我是爱普莉尔·奥尼尔 来见埃里克·赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, it's April O'Neil, here to see Eric Sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.16,0:34:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔今年来得比较早啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April's arrived early this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.77,0:34:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉就这么闯了进来 赛克斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to barge in on you like this, Mr. Sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.59,0:34:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 完全没有 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.65,0:34:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.57,0:34:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在研究一个报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been working on a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.97,0:34:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,初步理论是 有一些正义卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have this theory that there are these vigilantes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.14,0:34:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在与大脚帮作斗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that are fighting back against the Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.09,0:34:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是你和我父亲创造了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you and my father may have created them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.49,0:34:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:34:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能请您告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you please tell me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.95,0:34:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,关于文艺复兴项目的所有信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you know about Project Renaissance?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.23,0:35:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 那曾是一个梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, um, it was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那个梦想和你父亲一起逝去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dream that died with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它没有逝去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it isn't dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.63,0:35:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那场大火 我们失去了所有研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost all our research in the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的试验品 一切都没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all our specimens, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.78,0:35:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了15年的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent the last 15 years
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.22,0:35:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,试图重制出当年的成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to replicate the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.29,0:35:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那场大火并没有吞噬所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't lose everything in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.46,0:35:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.69,0:35:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.96,0:35:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我见到了他们四个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw all four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的想了解文艺复兴项目吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really want to know about Project Renaissance?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.95,0:35:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我在日本出生 在冲绳的一个军事基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born in Japan, at a military base in Okinawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.78,0:35:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的父亲去了越南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father went to Vietnam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.69,0:35:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,之后并没有回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.49,0:36:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我孤身一人在异国他乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was an outsider in a foreign land.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.47,0:36:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,被当成怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.85,0:36:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当时的我脆弱而无助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a powerless and helpless boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,直到一个当地老师收我为徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until a local sensei took me under his wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.08,0:36:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他救了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.79,0:36:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,教了我很多知识 之后我也跟你父亲分享了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taught me lessons that I later shared with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.70,0:36:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,十九世纪的日本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninth-century Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一个邪恶的军阀控制着那片土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An evil warlord ruled the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.66,0:36:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他在供水系统里下了毒 开启了黑暗时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He poisoned the water supply, bringing on the dark ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.25,0:36:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡和疾病肆意猖獗 哀横遍野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death and disease and suffering ran rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.14,0:36:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就像大脚帮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unlike the Foot Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.01,0:36:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也想毁掉我们的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what they'd like to do to our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.97,0:36:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,之后有一天 出现了一个英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then one day, a hero arose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.99,0:36:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一个伟大的炼金术士研究出了解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A great alchemist discovered the antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.34,0:36:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,解了军阀所下的毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the warlord's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.34,0:36:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,针对邪恶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cure-all
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,万灵药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for his evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你父亲就是在试图创造这个万灵药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father and I were trying to recreate that cure-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开发了一种变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We developed a mutagen
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.64,0:36:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可以在细胞层级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}capable of stimulating self-repair
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,激发自我修复功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a cellular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.99,0:36:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们准备用它干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you going to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine New York City,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.52,0:37:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,遭到某种化学攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being victim to a chemical attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.29,0:37:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这种变异原可以抵挡住这种影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mutagen would be able to reverse its effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.62,0:37:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它可以拯救城市 可以拯救人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would save the city, it would save the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那些实验对象 那些乌龟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those test subjects, those turtles...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.92,0:37:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们血液里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running in their blood
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就是最后的珍贵变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the last of this precious mutagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.41,0:37:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你刚刚告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And up until a few moments ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.52,0:37:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为我们失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.69,0:37:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他们死在了大火里 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought they died in the fire. How...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是怎么活下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could they have lived?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.87,0:37:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我救了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.65,0:37:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.41,0:37:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔 那些变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April, the mutagen possesses powers
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.93,0:37:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有着我们无法企及的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beyond our wildest hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你需要什么资源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever resources you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.84,0:37:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.55,0:37:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起努力 会找到他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's work together. We'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:38:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,人类历史的进程可能会因此改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The course of human history may depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.46,0:38:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.54,0:38:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你的电脑被我黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bam! You've been hacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.21,0:38:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我是多纳泰罗 还记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Donatello. Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.94,0:38:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,乌龟 四眼 不说我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turtle. Four eyes. But enough about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.35,0:38:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说过会去找你 来这里见我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We told you we'd find you. Meet us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人来 否则 否则我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And come alone. Or... Or else we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.11,0:38:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你会遭到惩罚 什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shall be punished and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.82,0:38:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.42,0:38:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们让我来这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.95,0:38:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我并没有带任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't bring anyone with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.11,0:38:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我的确…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.05,0:38:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你是爱普莉尔·奥尼尔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay! Are you April O'Neil?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.99,0:38:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,启动视网膜扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiating retinal scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.24,0:38:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,扫描 扫描 扫描 扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scanning, scanning, scanning, scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,扫描结束 是她 大伙 就是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan complete. It's her. It's her. Guys, it's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.23,0:39:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是她了 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course it's her, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.30,0:39:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 很开心你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Really glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想给你介绍一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. There's someone important
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.90,0:39:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很重要的人 不过在此之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we want to introduce you to, but first...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.89,0:39:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 欢迎来到我们的小屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, yeah, welcome to my crib, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.11,0:39:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.97,0:39:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的孤独堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's our Fortress of Solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.44,0:39:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的霍格沃茨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.06,0:39:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的泽维尔学院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Xavier Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最先进的奇妙世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State-of-the-art WonderDome!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.55,0:39:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在下水道里面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we in the sewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.13,0:39:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.37,0:39:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 其实是的 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Technically, yes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.95,0:39:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 就是下水道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's a sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.57,0:39:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是你把我们带到这里来的 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought us here, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.09,0:39:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,斯普林特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splinter?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.22,0:39:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么知道他的名字的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does she know his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.10,0:39:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是你告诉她的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you tell her his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.56,0:39:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也许她是千里眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she's clairvoyant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.24,0:39:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许她是绝地武士呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she's a Jedi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.41,0:39:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.18,0:39:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你确实有双和你父亲一样的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always did have your father's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.27,0:40:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕 我会告诉你一切的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid. All will be made clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.99,0:40:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 你来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 学生
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.67,0:40:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有奇迹出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.39,0:40:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那些一直妨碍我们的义务警员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vigilantes who've been causing us so much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.02,0:41:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是实验对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.94,0:41:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为死在大火里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those itty-bitty box turtles
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.75,0:41:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那些小箱龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we thought we lost in the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.89,0:41:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还活着 施莱德大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're alive, Master Shredder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.24,0:41:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 他们还成长得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they've grown into something
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.71,0:41:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,十分强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.17,0:41:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他们不是易事 但一旦我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be easy to capture them, but if we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.94,0:41:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can finally carry out the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.24,0:41:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,多年前一直筹备的计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we had all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.84,0:41:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 我的大脚帮会更强大 而你将富可敌国
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市会成为我们掌中之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.60,0:41:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 找到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是奥尼尔的女儿找到了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil's daughter was the one who found them
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.35,0:41:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她会带领我们找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she will be the one who will take us right to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.46,0:41:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有脉冲信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.29,0:41:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经突破了他们的隐身安全系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've breached the cloaking security.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.39,0:42:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen closely, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.49,0:42:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember a time
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.45,0:42:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去那实验室之前的生活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before living in that laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.31,0:42:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那宿命的一夜同往常一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That fateful night started like any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.08,0:42:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯给我们进行了注射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks gave us our injections.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.63,0:42:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的父亲保证我们的生命体征依然强健\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father made sure our vital signs were strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.99,0:42:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而你 一如往常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, as always,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.91,0:42:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们带来了小奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}provided us with a special treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.73,0:42:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在兄弟们睡着之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the brothers went to sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.09,0:42:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了很大的声响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard loud voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.47,0:42:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻到了烟味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was the smell of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.06,0:42:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,警铃响起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alarms sounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.14,0:42:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲发现了他的老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father had discovered the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.26,0:42:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,做实验的真实企图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind the man he was working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.84,0:42:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他放火烧了实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He set fire to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.18,0:42:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,努力摧毁施莱德的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His last breath was taken
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.10,0:43:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,也咽下了最后一口气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to destroy Shredder's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.29,0:43:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但就在那时 你出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, you appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.46,0:43:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们带到了安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ushered us to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.05,0:43:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时无法说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had a voice then,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.48,0:43:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但我现在想谢谢你 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I thank you now, April.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.36,0:43:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直在下水道里游荡直到我找到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wandered the sewers until I found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.95,0:43:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was then that the mutagen
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.85,0:43:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们血液中的变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was injected into our blood
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.09,0:43:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,奇迹般地改造了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}began to change us in miraculous ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我目睹过你父亲对你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw how your father loved you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.97,0:43:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我必须对神龟们施以同样的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I knew I had to show that same love to the turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.50,0:43:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我成为了他们的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I became their father
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.98,0:43:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们则成为了我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they became my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.86,0:43:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,同所有的孩子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like all children, they were drawn
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也被流行文化吸引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the distractions of popular culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.87,0:44:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道总有一天他们会去探索地面之上的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew one day they would want to explore the world above.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.06,0:44:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会被嘲笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would be ridiculed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.18,0:44:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们得学会如何保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would need to learn to protect themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.77,0:44:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是身体还是心理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both mentally and physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.45,0:44:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想玩"打小桶"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Does anyone want to play Buck-Buck?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.15,0:44:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一个桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck one!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.29,0:44:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,两个桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck two!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.48,0:44:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,三个桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck three!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.98,0:44:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿 拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going, Raph?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.27,0:44:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 我一个人做不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I can't do it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.99,0:44:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,得四个人一起才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need all four!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.65,0:44:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是桶渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a Buck short.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.55,0:44:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来好蠢 就和你一样 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that sounds stupid. Like you, Mikey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.60,0:44:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你只负责搞热气氛嘛 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're just the hype man, bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.80,0:44:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见这些动作了吗 - 我才不管呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See these moves? - Yeah, whatever, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.77,0:44:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我找到了一种方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.65,0:44:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我自学这种古老的忍术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I would teach myself the ancient art of Ninjutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小龟们则跟随我的指导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brothers followed my lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.97,0:45:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以飞一般地速度成长起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accelerating at a wondrous rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.01,0:45:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 兄弟 要来试试吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wassup, bra? Want some of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.65,0:45:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就像幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.91,0:45:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里 我又在这里 就像一道暗影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm over here, now I'm over here, bra. Like a shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.50,0:45:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是火焰暗影龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a flame shadow fire dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.28,0:45:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的天赋正是他们的热情所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their gift was also their passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.66,0:45:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们活着 呼吸着 并梦想着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lived, breathed and dreamed
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.16,0:45:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,和武术相关的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all things martial arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.06,0:45:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.25,0:45:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.95,0:45:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,武士刀 所有刀刃中最高贵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The katana, most noble of all the blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.66,0:45:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,领袖所用的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the weapon of a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.29,0:46:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.90,0:46:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,以及他们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everything that they've become
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.85,0:46:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都离不开你在那宿命的一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was made possible by the bravery that
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.56,0:46:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,所展现出的勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you displayed on that fateful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.21,0:46:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.21,0:46:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我那时只是个小女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.15,0:46:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别人可能会把我们关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you gave us freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你却赐予了我们自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where others would have kept us in cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.07,0:46:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.36,0:46:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年来你一直告诉我们 在那场大火中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these years you told us we were rescued from the fire
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.73,0:46:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫作保护者的守护神救了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a great guardian spirit, the Hogo-sha.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.47,0:46:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.91,0:46:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是那位保护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is the Hogo-sha.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.79,0:46:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.84,0:47:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我女朋友就是保护者啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My girlfriend's totally the Hogo-sha.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.69,0:47:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 我们的工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, our engineers
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.96,0:47:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对您盔甲的机械技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been making great progress
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.05,0:47:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,做了很大的改进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in refining the robotics in your armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.68,0:47:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们提升了它的层次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking it to the next level,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,结合了古代传统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bridging the gap between ancient tradition
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.39,0:47:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,和现代战术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and modern warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.23,0:47:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[日语] 今晚 我要喝乌龟汤
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.86,0:47:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么把我带到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.22,0:47:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要知道你把我们的存在告诉了谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find out who you told of our existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.94,0:47:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,除了埃里克·赛克斯 没人相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody that believed me, except for Eric Sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.61,0:47:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.04,0:47:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真是怕什么来什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.92,0:47:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯不是善类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks is not a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.60,0:47:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他的心灵已被荼毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His soul has been poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.57,0:47:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,荼毒他的是暗夜帝王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the influence of a dark master.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.84,0:47:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shredder.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.06,0:48:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德在日本把赛克斯抚养成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder practically raised Sacks in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.16,0:48:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像是赛克斯的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's like a father to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.01,0:48:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为了主人 赛克斯什么都愿意做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks will do anything for his master.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.35,0:48:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.29,0:48:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯和施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks and Shredder?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.09,0:48:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们为什么不出去抓他们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why aren't we out there hunting them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.75,0:48:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔 那是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, Raphael,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.91,0:48:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德是有史以来最残忍的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Shredder is a skilled warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.87,0:48:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,并且 他战斗技术娴熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose cruelty is ever-reaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.67,0:48:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而你们不过是一群少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are just teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.07,0:48:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们血液中的变异原对他们很有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mutagen in your blood is of great value to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.51,0:48:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在赛克斯已经确信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that Sacks has confirmation
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.18,0:48:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you are alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.00,0:48:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕他们会来找我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear they will bring the fight to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.57,0:48:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.17,0:48:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,准备进入 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to make entry. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.12,0:48:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.38,0:48:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有人入侵 已经侵入 有人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perimeter infringe. Breached! We have incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:48:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 有两队人马侵入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Oh, no! We got two breaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.23,0:49:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,通风机室和武器墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fan room, weapons wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.72,0:49:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 从右侧包抄 多尼跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, flank right! Donnie, on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.65,0:49:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得出发了 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.62,0:49:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,准备装载炸药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to set charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.54,0:49:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹上膛 10秒后突进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock and load. We're going on 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.89,0:49:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,别用实弹 只准用麻醉弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No live ammo. Tranqs only.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.30,0:49:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,活捉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 'em alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.11,0:49:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.22,0:49:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.34,0:49:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.73,0:49:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.15,0:49:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在那里 麻醉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are! Neutralize them!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.29,0:49:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有麻醉弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got tranq darts!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.82,0:49:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别碰到那子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't let them hit your skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.50,0:49:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.15,0:50:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.24,0:50:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,目标在正前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tango at 12!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.31,0:50:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛 兄弟 你觉得你能搞定这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wassup, bra? Oh, you think you can handle this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.90,0:50:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我行如闪电 蠢货们 我闪我闪我闪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a snapping turtle, fool. Snap, snap, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.82,0:50:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我故意的 我故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I meant to do that! I meant to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.88,0:50:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,通风机室有人侵入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a breach in the fan room!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.06,0:50:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐 去通风机室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph! Get to the fan room!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.37,0:50:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,凭什么你老使唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you always telling me what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.73,0:50:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快去 麦奇 你得把爱普莉尔带出去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go! Mikey, you gotta get April out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.30,0:50:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.65,0:50:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.89,0:50:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在哪儿藏着最安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a safe place for you to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.23,0:50:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你口渴的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you get thirsty,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我在冰箱后偷藏了橙子汽水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a secret stash of Orange Crush behind the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.25,0:50:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell Raph.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.87,0:50:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.32,0:51:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these years
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想重造那个变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trying to recreate the mutagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.29,0:51:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.31,0:51:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真是得来全不费工夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just handed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.08,0:51:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你休想伤害我的儿子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not lay a hand on my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.00,0:51:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sons?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.73,0:51:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然觉得你是他们的父亲吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're their father?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.76,0:51:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊 小老鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.66,0:52:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.25,0:53:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.98,0:53:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 李奥 我马上就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Leo! Be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.89,0:53:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.58,0:53:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.02,0:53:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.56,0:53:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不 儿子 别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my son, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.53,0:54:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.58,0:54:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 你在 你要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! What are you... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.23,0:54:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.91,0:54:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.80,0:54:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,保护好自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.90,0:54:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children, drop your weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.59,0:54:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,否则 你们的父亲必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or your father will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.98,0:55:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.05,0:55:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.28,0:55:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the fourth?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.97,0:55:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.74,0:55:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,毁了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.00,0:55:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.16,0:55:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.90,0:55:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,记住 痛苦只是大脑的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, pain's only in the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.96,0:56:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,进去 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move along! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,军队 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Troop, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.84,0:56:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.98,0:56:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,斯普林特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splinter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.20,0:57:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.25,0:57:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.00,0:57:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,送他去医疗室吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get him to the needle room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.45,0:57:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,货物安全 已经上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Package is secured. En route.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.40,0:57:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,带来了三只乌龟 大概40分钟后到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are carrying 3 specimens and will be arriving at the estate in approximately 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.52,0:57:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好密封间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare the containment units.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.04,0:57:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些乌龟的身体里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside those turtles
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.36,0:57:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有地球上最珍贵的化合物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the most precious compound on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.05,0:57:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mutagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.36,0:57:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,为了得到变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we will drain every last
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.60,0:57:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要榨干他们的最后一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ounce of their blood to get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们也在所不惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if it kills them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.97,0:58:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,去拿急救箱 就在架子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the first aid kit! On the shelf!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.99,0:58:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.41,0:58:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.84,0:58:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.75,0:58:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要救出你的兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must save your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop Shredder.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.56,0:58:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.32,0:58:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是某种跟踪装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some kind of tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.84,0:58:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是多纳泰罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Donatello!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.37,0:58:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快去 拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.92,0:58:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去救我的兄弟吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go save my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.60,0:58:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要搭便车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.81,0:59:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.17,0:59:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 弗恩 10分钟后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Vern, I need you to meet me
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.71,0:59:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在柯特兰小路见 拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Cortlandt Alley in 10 minutes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.89,0:59:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.87,0:59:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在电话里说不清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't talk to you about it on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.93,0:59:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我 你一定要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just promise you're gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.14,0:59:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫说不清 电话是你打给…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, you can't talk about... You called...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.99,0:59:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.17,0:59:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 要我现在就去见你对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Want me to meet you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.02,0:59:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就配合你好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll play your little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.19,0:59:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这帽子是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.05,0:59:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is with the...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.73,0:59:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 这是我朋友的 我失策了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, it's a buddy of mine's. It's just a goof.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.67,0:59:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干点什么 去市中心如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to do? You wanna head downtown?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,埃里克·赛克斯在为大脚帮首领工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric Sacks is working with the head of the Foot Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.25,0:59:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把正义乌龟卫士抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just kidnapped the vigilante turtles
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.77,0:59:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要把他们带到赛克斯府邸去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take them to the Sacks estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.91,0:59:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得过去 快点 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go. Come on, Vern.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好 好 乌龟 我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, right, right. The turtles. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.29,0:59:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这有些为难我了 奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is getting embarrassing. O'Neil,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.68,1:00:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是成年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're both consenting adults.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.57,1:00:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,长得都挺不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both very good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.41,1:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你更好看些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're better, probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.53,1:00:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点待议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's up for debate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.32,1:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但问题是 我们不需要找借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the point is, we don't need to make up excuses
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.78,1:00:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 才能跟彼此见面 - 你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to hang out with each other. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.42,1:00:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你想多跟我待在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to spend more time with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.30,1:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 我也想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it. I would too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.24,1:00:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就得去赛克斯府邸 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get to the Sacks estate right now, Vern.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.32,1:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 我就是说这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - That's what I'm talking about,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.52,1:00:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么赛克斯府邸和正义卫士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Sacks estate with the vigilante...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.29,1:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个会说话的乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a talking turtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.91,1:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我是个会说话的乌龟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, I'm a talking turtle,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个呆子人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're a human nerd.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.74,1:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,既然理清楚身份了 踩油门吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that we got that out of the way, hit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.75,1:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没人说我是呆子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been accused of being a nerd before, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.24,1:00:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,请问一下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.34,1:00:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么进到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get in...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.37,1:00:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他是怎么进到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he get in the...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.29,1:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.68,1:01:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信 让我好好看看你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable. Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.73,1:01:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我见多识广 可这…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a hard guy to impress, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.60,1:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可这也…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.40,1:01:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.20,1:01:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来还想用兔子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we were gonna use rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.21,1:01:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,能想象吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.15,1:01:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本来就想创造一种解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we were trying to do is create an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.87,1:01:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.21,1:01:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍 我想听你的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say that again. I want to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.50,1:01:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.56,1:01:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这么一个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, uh, we had this plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.25,1:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备今天重新实施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A plan that we're ready to put back online today.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.39,1:01:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你们展示的 卡莱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you. Karai.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.39,1:01:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.71,1:01:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やれ
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.45,1:01:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.97,1:01:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我的赛克斯之塔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know my building, Sacks Tower?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.98,1:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,最高处有个巨型尖顶的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got that great big spire up on top?
