Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.95,1:02:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.84,1:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如你们所见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.85,1:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西很不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kinda bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.99,1:02:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few hours,
