Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.76,1:02:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,洒满整个城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,初期死亡人数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The initial death toll
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.88,1:02:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对会让世界各政府为之震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will shake world governments to their core.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.95,1:02:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,三十天之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 30 days,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.13,1:02:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约城会成为隔离区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the city of New York will be a quarantine zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.49,1:02:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这时我的公司就会出面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that is where my company comes in.
