Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.56,1:02:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,拯救大家 而解药的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the antidote that is made from the mutagen
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.26,1:02:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你们血中流淌着的变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is oozing through your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.63,1:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,政府会给赛克斯企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government will then send Sacks Industry
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.80,1:02:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一张无限额支票 我会变得富有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a blank check and I'm going to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.30,1:02:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,富得一塌糊涂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, stupid rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.91,1:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德会驱使这座城市臣服于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder will force this city to live under our rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.84,1:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将成为神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.82,1:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有考虑过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I've thought about...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.28,1:03:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,倒不是说要当忍者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not becoming a ninja,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.70,1:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我练过一阵子瑜伽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was doing a bunch of yoga for like,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.24,1:03:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一度练了十天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}10 days at one point,
