Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.11,1:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大门在那 - 我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's the gate right there. - There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.71,1:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把门撞开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ram the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.98,1:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,把门撞开 这车可是归第六频道所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ram the gate"? This is Channel 6 property.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.85,1:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你把门撞开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said ram the gate!
