Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.77,1:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.91,1:03:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
