Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.93,1:04:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这罐拿到纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take this canister to New York
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.27,1:04:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,提取变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to withdraw the mutagen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要把他们的血抽干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure that you drain all their blood.
