Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.31,1:04:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad you could join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.30,1:04:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,第四个笼子是为你准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fourth cage is for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.14,1:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,摔得真惨 哥们儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's harsh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.90,1:05:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,老鼠没把你教好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rat did not teach you well!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.82,1:05:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.37,1:05:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.97,1:05:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的对手是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus on me.
