Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.99,1:05:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.76,1:05:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!
