Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.79,1:06:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肾上腺素 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Adrenaline. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.70,1:06:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,肾上腺素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.53,1:06:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,肾上腺素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.34,1:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.44,1:06:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,肾上腺素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.12,1:06:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.74,1:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.27,1:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,起效了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.22,1:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得咱们得让开点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should move.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.71,1:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在感觉真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel really good right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.22,1:07:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好想跑步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like running!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.19,1:07:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好想打扫卫生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.27,1:07:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想打扫道场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants to clean the dojo?
