Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.29,1:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,爽歪歪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.82,1:08:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,前进 开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Advance and engage!
