Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.60,1:09:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,经典蓝红线设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Classic blue wire/red wire situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.33,1:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有钥匙 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keys! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.73,1:09:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙更好用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys are better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.70,1:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开车 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Drive! - I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.83,1:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.84,1:09:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,后座上有个会说话的乌龟也是醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all I need is a backseat-driving talking turtle!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.46,1:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.07,1:09:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,十二点方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jackal-One-Tango, on your 12!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.88,1:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.62,1:09:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该怀疑你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't have doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.22,1:09:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我之前没信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry I didn't stick up for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.98,1:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你居然没疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe that you're not crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.36,1:09:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How crazy is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.55,1:09:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,目标 十二点方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target, 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.84,1:09:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.33,1:09:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 去曼哈顿最快是哪条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie, what's the fastest way back to Manhattan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.24,1:09:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要在这条路上开就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need to stay on this road.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.59,1:09:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能到山脚下的维修舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can get to the maintenance hatch at the bottom of the hill,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.64,1:09:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有条四公里的下水管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a sewer line 2.4 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.56,1:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 告诉前面那两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey! Let them know up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.84,1:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.78,1:09:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 走 走 走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.55,1:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.76,1:10:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.07,1:10:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩 踩刹车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern, hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.76,1:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,反了 反了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong way! Wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.15,1:10:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快追 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go around! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 李奥 快让开 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leo, move, move! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.43,1:10:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,转过来 转过来 转过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opposite, opposite, opposite!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.98,1:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.48,1:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们偏离了路线多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far off course are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.08,1:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我们现在走上了捷径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, we're on a bit of a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.86,1:10:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们得一直开下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need to keep going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.57,1:10:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一直往下开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.92,1:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.20,1:11:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,往下开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going straight!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.63,1:11:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗 美人儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, angel cakes?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.46,1:11:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.34,1:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 李奥有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, Leo's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.42,1:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的壳裂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My shell's cracked.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.67,1:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,随便粘起来就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tape it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.89,1:11:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我出次风头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to be the bad-ass for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.94,1:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,挺住了 李奥 解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Leo. Disengaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.55,1:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 我一直想试试这招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I've always wanted to try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.89,1:12:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定一辆 还有两辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One car down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.46,1:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.54,1:12:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.29,1:12:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.79,1:12:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐 我在开车诶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph, I'm driving! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.99,1:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.86,1:12:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 你继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.09,1:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要都拍下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you're getting everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.40,1:12:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.17,1:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.52,1:13:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔 把胳膊给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil! Give me your arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.63,1:13:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vern!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.40,1:13:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,雪崩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.82,1:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 李奥 快醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Leo, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.15,1:13:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! If you wake up,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.12,1:13:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证乖乖听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise to do anything you say!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.17,1:13:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 施莱德的直升机离纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! Shredder's chopper is 20 miles
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.05,1:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有三十二公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outside of New York City airspace!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.46,1:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢播报交通情况 多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the traffic update, Donnie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.12,1:13:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来要播体育和天气吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You doing sports and weather next?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.37,1:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你现在就这么生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're gonna be nasty about it
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.41,1:13:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你肯定不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I guess you don't want to know
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.49,1:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,53秒后会有150米落差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there's a 500-foot drop-off in 53 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.87,1:13:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying there's...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.69,1:13:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有悬崖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cliff!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.38,1:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把爱普莉尔救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get April out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.91,1:13:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐 注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph, heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.10,1:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了那个老头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget that old guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.47,1:13:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,计划有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.06,1:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.44,1:14:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,低头 低头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.19,1:14:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还有20秒我们就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twelve seconds and we're going over!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.81,1:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼 用弹弓那招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Donnie, do that fancy slingshot thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.79,1:14:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把阳光小姐救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to take Little Miss Sunshine out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.08,1:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,击球员就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batter up!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.91,1:14:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.67,1:14:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 抓住钢缆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey! Grab the cable!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.93,1:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住了 抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.04,1:14:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.02,1:14:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.61,1:15:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.44,1:15:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.05,1:15:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的李奥 爱普莉尔…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Leo, April...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.20,1:15:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that other guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.26,1:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们那么年轻 那么漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were so young, so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.60,1:15:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没死 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ain't dead, dumb nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.59,1:15:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Right on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.95,1:15:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你的龟壳下面有降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you got a parachute under that shell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.20,1:15:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 是维修舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys! It's the maintenance hatch!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.34,1:15:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可以回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ticket home!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.67,1:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,先帮我一把好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little help, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.79,1:15:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我们得赶紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we gotta hustle.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.09,1:15:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德已经到纽约市了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder's over New York City!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.83,1:15:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 变异原还有四分钟就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei, the mutagen is four minutes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.81,1:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,按照计划前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving forward as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.17,1:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,记住不要把胳膊腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please keep your arms and legs
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.27,1:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,伸出龟壳外哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside the shell at all times.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.26,1:16:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星图像显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellite imagery shows
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.39,1:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德已经到达赛克斯塔塔顶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder's reached the top of Sacks Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.20,1:16:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他从那里释放毒素…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's where he's releasing the toxin from...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.00,1:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那整个纽约就要完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna spread all over the city!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.40,1:16:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,左拐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...break a left!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.79,1:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好 大家听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.86,1:16:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到电梯 坐电梯上塔顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta find the elevators and get up to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.85,1:16:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get to a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.25,1:16:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 我们可以去找赛克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, we can go find Sacks
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.73,1:16:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,从他手里抢来变异原 作为应急方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get our hands on the mutagen as a contingency plan,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.92,1:16:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…以防万一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just in case... you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.67,1:16:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你这么"信任"我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the vote of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.78,1:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't make it back,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.22,1:16:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就把变异原带去给斯普林特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring the mutagen to Splinter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可以救他一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can save his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.57,1:16:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,赛克斯的实验室在36楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sacks's laboratory's on the 36th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.04,1:16:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经把安保系统禁用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already disabled the security system.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.27,1:16:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.40,1:16:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,祝大家好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.84,1:16:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不回来 不要忘记我 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't return, remember me, April.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.74,1:16:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一直\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can always find me
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.36,1:17:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.87,1:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你这么有"故事"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a complicated chick.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.88,1:17:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.48,1:17:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,电梯就在拐角处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elevator's just around this corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.82,1:17:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.82,1:17:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,按我的计划来 我们就不会失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stick to my plan and we won't fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.93,1:17:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,大家散开 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fan out in three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.29,1:17:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.88,1:17:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.47,1:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,第一瓶解毒剂正在装瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first vial is filling with antidote now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.59,1:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,启动毒剂释放程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiating the toxin release procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.22,1:18:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇控麦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MC Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.80,1:18:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,控麦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MC
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.45,1:19:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,准备出招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready, stance!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.82,1:19:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 还记得我们小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mikey, remember that thing you used to say
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.63,1:19:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常说的那句话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we were kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.81,1:19:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你说不允许我再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made me promise never to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.96,1:19:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.69,1:19:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得怎么说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still got one in the tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.47,1:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我都蓄势待发好多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been holding it in for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.58,1:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 我们得先定个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we need a plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.46,1:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,考厄崩格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowabunga!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.72,1:19:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.12,1:19:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生交火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we got a 10-10.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.42,1:19:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有碎片正从赛克斯大楼上落下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debris falling from the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.98,1:19:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.48,1:19:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我 兄弟们 我来对付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this, guys! I'll take him!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.88,1:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.51,1:20:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人可对付不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.97,1:20:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.62,1:20:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you two...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.64,1:20:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩可真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're adorable, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.59,1:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱到我想捏捏你们的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could just pinch your cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.35,1:20:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 他过来了 他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, he's coming, he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.13,1:20:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.60,1:20:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.53,1:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.68,1:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 李奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.43,1:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小姑娘老想着死去的爸爸 这个我懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand a girl with dead daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.44,1:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 但你阻止不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do. But you're not gonna stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.46,1:21:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是历史重演啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is history repeating itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.73,1:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲也阻止过我 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father walked in on me, April,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.72,1:21:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.06,1:21:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我没费这么多子弹就把他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took a few less bullets to take him down, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.52,1:21:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是你杀了我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.22,1:21:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快上 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.00,1:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快点上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.39,1:21:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.51,1:21:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.54,1:22:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 教训就到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough. The lesson is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.14,1:22:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们被他打得好惨啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting our asses kicked out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.54,1:22:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有五十秒时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only got 50 more seconds
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.13,1:22:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,否则毒剂就要释放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the toxin's released.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.89,1:22:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.18,1:22:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想玩打小桶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants to play Buck-Buck?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.78,1:22:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,打小桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck-Buck?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.59,1:22:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 打小桶 又叫骑小马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Buck-Buck. Tony-on-a-Pony.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.91,1:22:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也有人称之为垫石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people call it Johnnie-on-a-Rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.18,1:22:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.21,1:22:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.13,1:22:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩打小桶吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's play Buck-Buck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.17,1:22:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是我们为什么… - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But why would we... - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.78,1:22:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,听李奥的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do what Leo says.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.38,1:22:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你先上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.63,1:22:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,奥尼尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O'Neil!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.52,1:23:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,考厄崩格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowabunga.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.27,1:23:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.64,1:24:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快带上变异原去找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just go get some help and take the mutagen with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.79,1:24:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快去 快去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go. Go! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.61,1:24:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一名实干家 这一天很平常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just another day in the life of a man of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.65,1:24:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 我起不来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not getting up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.68,1:24:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用这玩意儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to use this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.73,1:24:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个简单的命令运行界面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a simple command-line interface.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.49,1:24:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这种代码已经有15年没人用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's used this code in 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.84,1:24:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也只是在网上看到过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I've read about it online.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.05,1:24:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要弄明白这玩意儿需要时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these kind of things take time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.99,1:24:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想过有一天纽约整个城市的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking there was no way I'd ever be in a position
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.58,1:24:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,会掌握在我手上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the fate of an entire city...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.68,1:24:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我去给你争取时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll buy you some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.12,1:24:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,毒剂释放倒计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toxin disbursement
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.51,1:24:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,五 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in five, four,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.04,1:24:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.79,1:24:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.38,1:24:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 系统解除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bam! System disabled!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.93,1:24:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想吃意式披萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants Italian?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.74,1:24:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我请客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm buying!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.54,1:25:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,免费请大家吃提拉米苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiramisu for everybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.45,1:25:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,塔要倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.72,1:25:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,顶住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.76,1:25:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,顶住 顶住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.94,1:25:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果尖塔倒塌毒剂跌落到地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the spire falls and the toxin makes ground impact,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.25,1:25:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,污染范围会覆盖十个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll contaminate a 10-block radius!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.29,1:25:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能阻止这种情况发生的概率是多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are the odds of us stopping that from happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.42,1:25:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,百分之零点零零零零零零零零零零三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, 0.00000000003%!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.12,1:25:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意冒这个险 无论如何谁都不准走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it. Nobody moves, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.77,1:25:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 李奥…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Leo...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.75,1:25:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了谁都不准走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said nobody moves!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.31,1:25:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥 我顶不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo, I'm letting go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.56,1:26:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,施莱德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shredder!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.80,1:26:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,变异原就剩这么多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all that's left!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.89,1:26:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,小姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.39,1:26:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.46,1:26:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,顶住 顶住啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.31,1:26:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,顶住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.56,1:26:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,后退 大家都后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back! All the way back!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.35,1:26:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.59,1:27:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.97,1:27:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}April!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.12,1:27:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了 拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you, Raph!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.76,1:27:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.75,1:27:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了 爱普莉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on! April!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.93,1:27:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.31,1:27:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把我往他那边甩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swing me towards him!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.30,1:27:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.08,1:27:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,李奥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leo!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.72,1:28:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.02,1:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好像快死了 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.88,1:28:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谁有什么话要说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone have anything they want to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.61,1:28:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donnie?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.55,1:28:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是我每天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one who licks the icing
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.99,1:28:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把馅饼上面的酥皮都舔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}off the Pop-Tarts every morning
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.34,1:28:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再放回盒子里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and puts them back in the box.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.24,1:28:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.63,1:28:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我真心不懂《迷失》的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I so did not understand the ending of Lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.97,1:28:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.14,1:28:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.39,1:29:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是我们在一起的最后一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if this is our last moment together,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.77,1:29:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟大家说一声对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you guys to know I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.64,1:29:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我对你们那么严厉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I was so hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.03,1:29:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我都逼你们 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I pushed you, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.88,1:29:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我威胁你们 冲你们吼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I threatened you, I yelled at you,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.80,1:29:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我逼你们突破自己的极限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pushed you beyond your limits,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.35,1:29:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我相信你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was because I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.67,1:29:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in each one of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.63,1:29:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你们的精神 相信你们的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe in your spirit and your intelligence
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.24,1:29:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也相信你们的潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your potential.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.36,1:29:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我说要走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time I talked about walking away,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.90,1:29:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was because I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.04,1:29:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得我不够优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just didn't think I was good enough
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.60,1:29:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没资格站在你们身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stand next to you
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.00,1:29:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你们兄弟 并且跟你们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and call you brothers and say to you
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.30,1:29:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.61,1:29:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很爱你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you guys so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.23,1:29:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raph?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.63,1:29:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.91,1:29:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在哭吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.26,1:29:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, ding-dong.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.72,1:29:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只是灰尘进了眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little dusty out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.75,1:30:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 变异原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, the mutagen is now
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.29,1:30:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,已经进了他的血液循环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}entering his bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.23,1:30:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,斯普林特大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Splinter?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.30,1:30:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.78,1:30:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么还没起作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't it working yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.91,1:30:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.63,1:30:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,麦奇 靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.82,1:30:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么 说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say? What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.43,1:30:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他说"把你的膝盖从我胸口上拿开"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "Please get your knee off my chest."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.88,1:30:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.01,1:30:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你活过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.19,1:30:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,起作用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 一切都是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. This was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.16,1:30:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.19,1:30:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We weren't ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.06,1:30:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.40,1:31:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是我没准备好放开你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was I who wasn't ready to let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.41,1:31:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只需要去发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you needed was to discover
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.78,1:31:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们真正的力量在于彼此团结信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your true power lies in believing in one another.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.87,1:31:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.94,1:31:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,纽约的秘密武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York's secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.04,1:31:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你胳膊怎么样了 弗恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your arm, Vern?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.85,1:31:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟人打架是用不上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it wouldn't be much use in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.01,1:31:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然之前我也不怎么会打架 但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I was much use before, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.45,1:31:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你买了新车吗 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get a new car? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.96,1:31:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是新的芬威克专车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at the new Fenwick Express.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.40,1:31:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不错吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty sweet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.19,1:31:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,其实还升级了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.08,1:31:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,之前上班开的车毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured I'd need new wheels
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.96,1:31:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我需要辆新车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after my old work vehicle went boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.32,1:31:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 是第六频道给我买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Channel 6 gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.64,1:31:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还说不要刮伤一丝一毫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said don't put a scratch on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.90,1:31:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 一个人还能被雷劈中两回不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, like, lightning's going to strike twice?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我来就是想跟我说这个吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, is that why you called me here,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.08,1:31:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说你的新车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to talk about your new car?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.13,1:31:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你不是那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you're not exactly
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.21,1:32:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,带去高档餐厅吃一顿就开心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fancy restaurant kind of girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.26,1:32:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我就想 可能你更喜欢大半夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I figured a creepy underpass in an abandoned neighborhood
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.09,1:32:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来一个废旧街区的高架桥下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the night was more your speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.23,1:32:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你觉得自在些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted you to be comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.59,1:32:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,DJ麦奇来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DJ Mikey in the house!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.35,1:32:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.56,1:32:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮我们保守秘密 我们该跟你道声谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We figured we owed you a thanks for keeping our secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.84,1:32:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们的事曝光 你肯定能得到不少好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a lot to gain from telling people about us,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.03,1:32:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你一直挺我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you had our backs.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.83,1:32:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们是一家人 拉斐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, 'cause that's what family's for, Raph.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.29,1:32:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们也开车行动了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you guys are driving now?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.79,1:32:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊老兄 我把这家伙彻底改造了一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, man. I pimped this bad boy out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.79,1:32:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,上面装了42英寸等离子电视 可以看NBA所有比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a 42-inch plasma with the NBA package,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.45,1:32:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还有绵绵冰制冰机 7.1数字立体音响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shave ice machine, 7.1 digital surround sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.17,1:32:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来听听贝斯音 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the bass, bra.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.84,1:33:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我还不是很熟悉各种按键功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bad. I'm still figuring out the buttons.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.06,1:33:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是我新买的芬威克专车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my new Fenwick Express!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.32,1:33:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我刚买的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just... I just got that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.46,1:33:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We better get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.73,1:33:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,需要我们送你们回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want a ride home?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.14,1:33:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我们还是坐地铁吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I think we're gonna take the subway.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.66,1:33:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起去坐地铁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to take the subway.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.71,1:33:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.93,1:33:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚写了一首很好听的歌呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a real nice song that's all cued up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.34,1:33:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 专门为你 美女 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's special, girl. - No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.96,1:33:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也为我们大家 - 行了 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For us. - Come on, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.72,1:33:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 麦奇 你答应我们不唱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, Mikey, you promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.75,1:33:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,*想象你我二人在一起*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*Imagine me and you, I do*
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.64,1:33:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,*我日夜都想念着你*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*I think about you day and night*
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.14,1:33:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,*只有想你才是…*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*It's only right to think about...*
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.18,1:33:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我这不是有很大进步了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm making really good headway!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.09,1:33:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你闭嘴 麦奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up, Mikey!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.75,1:34:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,*除你之外我谁都不会去爱*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*I can't see me loving nobody but you*
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.48,1:34:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,*你是我一生的挚爱*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*For all my life*
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.69,1:34:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,*每当你我在一起*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*When you're with me, baby*
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.05,1:34:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,*我的天空便一碧如洗*\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}*The skies'll be blue for all my life!*
